WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.037
I like to swing a lot!

2
00:00:08.038 --> 00:00:13.596
When I go higher, I hold on tight.

3
00:00:13.597 --> 00:00:21.000
When I go higher, I do many things.

4
00:00:21.001 --> 00:00:27.202
When I go higher, I smell the sunflowers.

5
00:00:27.203 --> 00:00:34.080
When I go higher, I say hi to the birds.

6
00:00:34.081 --> 00:00:38.186
When I go higher, I almost touch the clouds.

7
00:00:38.187 --> 00:00:43.184
Push me higher, please!

8
00:00:43.185 --> 00:00:47.767
When I go higher, I almost touch the airplane.

9
00:00:47.768 --> 00:00:52.671
Push me higher, please!

10
00:00:52.672 --> 00:00:56.835
When I go higher, I almost touch the sun.

11
00:00:56.836 --> 00:01:01.970
Push me lower, please!

12
00:01:01.971 --> 00:01:07.144
When I go lower, I say good-bye to the clouds.

13
00:01:07.145 --> 00:01:13.006
Push me lower, please!

14
00:01:13.007 --> 00:01:17.891
When I go lower, I say good-bye to the birds.

15
00:01:17.892 --> 00:01:22.214
Push me lower, please!

16
00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:27.313
When I go lower, I say good-bye to the sunflowers.

17
00:01:27.314 --> 00:01:31.191
Push me lower, please!

18
00:01:31.192 --> 00:01:35.957
Help me stop, please!

19
00:01:35.958 --> 00:01:41.832
I like to swing.

